---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Figure from "../components/Figure.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
import { getLinks } from "../lib/content";
import { site } from "../lib/site";
import { profilePageSchema } from "../lib/schema";

const links = await getLinks();

const facts = [
  { term: "Live in", detail: "New Orleans, Louisiana" },
  { term: "Day job", detail: "Chief Operating Officer, Live Oak Camp" },
  { term: "Also building", detail: "Watch Women's Sports (IRL)" },
  { term: "Grew up in", detail: "Baltimore, Maryland" },
  { term: "Studied", detail: "History and bioethics at UVA; M.S. Education at Johns Hopkins" },
  { term: "Run with", detail: "The 504th, and Youth Run NOLA as a coach" },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Lucy Schodell, formerly Lucy Scholz"
  bareTitle
  description="Lucy Schodell, who also raced as Lucy Scholz: ultrarunner, COO of Live Oak Camp, and founder of Watch Women's Sports (IRL), in New Orleans."
  schema={[profilePageSchema("/about/")]}
  ogPhoto="portrait-gobi-jack"
  crumbs={[{ name: "About", path: "/about/" }]}
>
  <article class="about">
    <div class="wrap top">
      <div class="top-text">
        <p class="label">About</p>
        <h1>I like doing hard things with a team.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Running is a team sport, but so is life.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="top-photo">
        <Figure
          photo="portrait-gobi-jack"
          ratio="4/5"
          sizes="(max-width: 56rem) 100vw, 40vw"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          caption="With Jack Carey after the Ultra Gobi 400K, where we finished together."
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          I grew up in Baltimore and spent ten summers at a camp in Virginia, first as a
          camper, then as a CIT, a counselor, and eventually head of the waterfront. I
          studied history and bioethics at the University of Virginia, moved to New Orleans
          in 2012 to teach geometry with Teach For America, and stayed.
        </p>

        <p>
          In 2015, I helped start <a href="https://www.liveoakcamp.com/" rel="noopener"
            >Live Oak Camp</a
          >, which is a sleep-away camp that connects New Orleans future leaders through
          time at camp, on back-packing trips, and in leadership development programs
          throughout the year. I've been there since the beginning and now run it as COO.
          It's the through-line for most of the rest: several of my races have doubled as
          fundraisers for camp scholarships, including the Ultra Gobi, which brought in
          more than $10,000.
        </p>

        <h2>The running</h2>

        <p>
          I ran my first marathon in 2008, as a college freshman, and my first ultra in
          2017. Then in March 2023 I entered The Speed Project Solo, an unsanctioned 293
          mile run from Santa Monica to Las Vegas. It was my first attempt at anything
          beyond 100 miles, and I won it outright in 84 hours and 45 minutes, with a crew of
          nine women behind me.
        </p>

        <p>
          Since then I've crossed the Atacama, run the Moab 240 with a ten week old at home,
          gone back to Los Angeles twice more, and finished the Ultra Gobi 400K in China.
          That one was 247 miles, self-navigated and self-supported, and it took 94 hours
          and change. I crossed the line holding hands with Jack Carey, who I've run a lot
          of miles with.
        </p>

        <blockquote>
          Running ultras has never really been about running or the numbers. It's about
          people, community, connection, and adventure.
        </blockquote>

        <h2>The building</h2>

        <p>
          In 2025 a friend who runs a women's sports bar told me she was spending hours
          every week just working out where games were being broadcast. So I built
          <a href="/projects/">Watch Women's Sports (IRL)</a>, which puts it all in one
          place: games you can go to, and games you can watch at home, across every league
          and level. In June 2026 it won the grand prize at Idea Village's Pitch Night here
          in New Orleans.
        </p>

        <p>
          The way I put it at that pitch: <em
            >"I'm equally excited about writing code and building databases as I am
            cheering on the Tulane women's basketball team."</em
          >
        </p>

        <p>
          I write about all of it, at length, on
          <a href="https://lucyschodell.substack.com" rel="noopener">Substack</a>. I live in
          New Orleans with my wife and daughter.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wrap facts-band">
      <dl class="facts">
        {
          facts.map((f) => (
            <div>
              <dt>{f.term}</dt>
              <dd>{f.detail}</dd>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="wrap photos">
      <Figure photo="moab-hug" ratio="3/2" sizes="(max-width: 48rem) 100vw, 50vw" />
      <Figure photo="atacama-crew" ratio="3/2" sizes="(max-width: 48rem) 100vw, 50vw" />
    </div>

    <div class="wrap contact">
      <h2 class="contact-title">Find me elsewhere</h2>
      <ul class="link-list">
        {
          links.map((l) => (
            <li>
              <a href={l.data.url} rel="me noopener">
                <Icon name={l.data.icon} size={18} />
                <span class="ll-label">{l.data.label}</span>
                {l.data.handle && <span class="ll-handle">{l.data.handle}</span>}
                {l.data.note && <span class="ll-note">{l.data.note}</span>}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
      <p class="alias">
        Some older press is filed under my former name, {site.formerName}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem) 0;
  }

  .top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 0.85fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .top h1 {
    margin-top: var(--space-s);
    font-size: var(--step-4);
    max-width: 15ch;
  }

  .lede {
    margin-top: var(--space-m);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 42ch;
  }

  /* Held to a readable measure, flush with the page's left edge. */
  .prose {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .prose p {
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.72;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .prose p + p {
    margin-top: var(--space-s);
  }

  .prose a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration-color: var(--rule-strong);
  }

  .prose h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-s);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .prose blockquote {
    margin: var(--space-l) 0;
    padding-left: var(--space-m);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--clay);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    line-height: 1.32;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .facts-band {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .facts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 16rem), 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-m);
    padding-block: var(--space-l);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .facts dt {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xs);
  }

  .facts dd {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .photos {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-m);
  }

  .contact {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .contact-title {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-s);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-l);
  }

  .link-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 16rem), 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-s);
  }

  .link-list a {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto auto;
    column-gap: var(--space-2xs);
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--space-s);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color var(--transition), background var(--transition);
  }

  .link-list a:hover {
    border-color: var(--clay);
    background: var(--clay-wash);
  }

  .link-list :global(svg) {
    grid-row: 1;
    grid-column: 1;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .ll-label {
    grid-row: 1;
    grid-column: 2;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ll-handle {
    grid-row: 2;
    grid-column: 2;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .ll-note {
    grid-row: 3;
    grid-column: 2;
    margin-top: var(--space-3xs);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .alias {
    margin-top: var(--space-m);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 56rem) {
    .top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .top-photo {
      max-width: 28rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .photos {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
